  abstract = {Maximum hands-off control is the optimal solution to the L{$^0$} optimal control problem. While convex approximation is typically used to relax this problem, it does not necessarily result in maximum hands-off control. Therefore, this study introduces a nonconvex approximation method and a class of nonconvex optimal control problems that are always equivalent to the maximum hands-off control problem. A computation method based on difference of convex functions optimization is then derived and numerically validated.},
